    "name": "SF-489 - Delete Account Fields - API Tests",
    "description": "API - SF-489 - Delete Account fields Series_Entity__c, Sub_Type__c, Legal_Entity__c, Legal_Entity_Lookup__c, Legal_Entity_Name__c\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nGenerated: 2026-01-18\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nSUMMARY:\n  Delete Account fields Series_Entity__c, Sub_Type__c, Legal_Entity__c, Legal_Entity_Lookup__c, Legal_Entity_Name__c\n\nDESCRIPTION:\n  As a Product Owner / Business Analyst I want the custom fields Series_Entity__c, \n  Sub_Type__c, Legal_Entity__c, Legal_Entity_Lookup__c and Legal_Entity_Name__c \n  removed from the Account object only So that the Account object is simplified and \n  obsolete/unused fields are cleaned up, while ensuring no other Salesforce object, \n  automation, integration, report, scheduled job, or managed package is negatively affected.\n\nFIELDS TO DELETE (Account object only):\n  1. Series_Entity__c\n  2. Sub_Type__c\n  3. Legal_Entity__c\n  4. Legal_Entity_Lookup__c\n  5. Legal_Entity_Name__c\n\nIMPORTANT:\n  - Fields should be removed from Account object ONLY\n  - Fields with same API names on other objects (e.g., Lead) should remain unchanged\n  - Verify fields do NOT exist on Account after deletion\n  - Verify fields still exist on Lead (if applicable)\n\nAPI TESTING REQUIREMENTS:\n  - Verify fields do NOT exist on Account (after deletion)\n  - Verify fields may still exist on Lead (if applicable)\n  - Attempt to use deleted fields on Account should fail\n  - CRUD operations validation\n  - Negative/boundary scenarios\n\nGenerated from: src/features/api/SF/SF-489.feature\n\nThis collection contains API tests for SF-489 work item.",
